  "expires": "2026-01-02",
  "html": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As we approach the end of the year, we’d like to share the remaining company holidays for 2025 and the first holidays of 2026. Please take note of the following dates:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"http://stacemployees.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/merry-christmas-819x1024.png\",\"id\":841,\"dimRatio\":50,\"overlayColor\":\"black\",\"isUserOverlayColor\":true,\"minHeight\":850,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover\" style=\"min-height:850px\"><img class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-841 size-large\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://stacemployees.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/merry-christmas-819x1024.png\" data-object-fit=\"cover\"/><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-black-background-color has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\"><strong>Thursday, January 1</strong>&nbsp;– New Year’s Day</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\"><strong>Friday, January 2</strong>&nbsp;– Day after New Year’s</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->"
